{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ark shudders. Warning bells cry out across the sky. For generations, your floating home has orbited the mighty Vortex in peace\u2014but that calm was a lie. Now, the storm awakens, its maelstrom tearing your world apart island by island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Leaper. A warrior with the impossible speed needed to dash between the fragments of your world and fight back. You must absorb the memories of fallen heroes, rebuild their weapons, and strike at the heart of the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Windblown, a lightning-fast action roguelite from Motion Twin, the crafters of Dead Cells. Fail, and everything you know will be scattered to the winds. No pressure\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAP INTO CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a bolt of lightning, freely dash through vast, ever-changing islands in the sky where each run is teeming with secrets to uncover. Find your rhythm in relentless battles against the Vortex's Sentinels, and face oppressive bosses who just can't wait to chew you up and spit you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER YOUR PERFECT BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leapers can absorb the memories of the fallen warriors who came before, unlocking special powers and allowing you to reforge their equipment. This unlocks countless combinations, letting you create unique and crazy synergies. Equip up to two weapons and use their bespoke playstyles to unleash super-powerful and hidden Alterattacks. Combine this with Gifts, handy Trinkets and droppable Magifishes to adapt to every situation by shifting your build on the fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH IS A LESSON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in the Vortex is intense and demanding; your success is forged by both skill and strategy. Each defeat sends you back to the Ark not with failure, but with progress: the knowledge of a boss's devastating attack, and the ability to unlock powerful new weapons, Gifts, and more. Death is not an end, but a chance to regroup, re-arm, and return with a vengeance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR OWN PATH, SOLO OR TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mastery of the storm alone, or rally with fellow Leapers in online co-op. Bring your friends to unleash chaos, combining your builds to execute spectacular combos that reward perfect teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR VOICE SHAPES THE VORTEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our development is forged by community feedback. Just as the community was essential in shaping Dead Cells, you, our players, are the key to Windblown's future. We are actively listening and building this game with you. If you want your voice to be heard, join our official Discord and be part of the conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, go and prove yourselves, Leapers. Dash into a lightning-fast adventure through the sky and get ready for a colorful death... Dismissed!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/922c4bd1d2e380039370af815ed806bcec9b8873.jpg"},{"name":"Rat Village","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/ec690667e71e1c6d9c334c30b98fd96a722713f3.jpg"},{"name":"Incubator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/96cda54b6ab151ce82bc4ecd0f113d2755c47f87.jpg"},{"name":"Fungal Swamp","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/09a21abfe8c68e5a569eed0672685192854ca472.jpg"},{"name":"FREND-43V3R","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/898c8d99aef551b93d027971f7d6947a8e3589b9.jpg"},{"name":"Pietro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/83592205b743005465828dfdbee2737b70f95217.jpg"},{"name":"Sigourney","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/311198833a1d4e224027b7e3d80c9f7895a767c3.jpg"},{"name":"Off with its head!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/a3d519dc02b31fa9a6d74a9c86a39d528029d2ee.jpg"},{"name":"Tribomber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/418a19b1451d519d9c1664d3e5514ed6a554d923.jpg"},{"name":"Headbanger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1911610/7ad1d249a1588bf6c53a7e0416d8abd38a7dba38.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1911610?t=1765357713","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/a8febce7309793151b18aa6655446115512c7bf2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765357713","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/867fa22c5c92b5755de63b7ac6c70c8742e1e9cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765357713","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/867fa22c5c92b5755de63b7ac6c70c8742e1e9cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765357713","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ark shudders. Warning bells cry out across the sky. For generations, your floating home has orbited the mighty Vortex in peace\u2014but that calm was a lie. Now, the storm awakens, its maelstrom tearing your world apart island by island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Leaper. A warrior with the impossible speed needed to dash between the fragments of your world and fight back. You must absorb the memories of fallen heroes, rebuild their weapons, and strike at the heart of the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Windblown, a lightning-fast action roguelite from Motion Twin, the crafters of Dead Cells. Fail, and everything you know will be scattered to the winds. No pressure\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ad1cd87df3e510649f1ae2c9d319b293.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEAP INTO CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a bolt of lightning, freely dash through vast, ever-changing islands in the sky where each run is teeming with secrets to uncover. Find your rhythm in relentless battles against the Vortex's Sentinels, and face oppressive bosses who just can't wait to chew you up and spit you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/ba2f9031a34440c88d1e4a5f85673881.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER YOUR PERFECT BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leapers can absorb the memories of the fallen warriors who came before, unlocking special powers and allowing you to reforge their equipment. This unlocks countless combinations, letting you create unique and crazy synergies. Equip up to two weapons and use their bespoke playstyles to unleash super-powerful and hidden Alterattacks. Combine this with Gifts, handy Trinkets and droppable Magifishes to adapt to every situation by shifting your build on the fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/af585c2449ceddfbe5bd107536c05ceb.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH IS A LESSON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in the Vortex is intense and demanding; your success is forged by both skill and strategy. Each defeat sends you back to the Ark not with failure, but with progress: the knowledge of a boss's devastating attack, and the ability to unlock powerful new weapons, Gifts, and more. Death is not an end, but a chance to regroup, re-arm, and return with a vengeance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR OWN PATH, SOLO OR TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mastery of the storm alone, or rally with fellow Leapers in online co-op. Bring your friends to unleash chaos, combining your builds to execute spectacular combos that reward perfect teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/948d231302d2108a84dc5be6254631f6.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR VOICE SHAPES THE VORTEX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our development is forged by community feedback. Just as the community was essential in shaping Dead Cells, you, our players, are the key to Windblown's future. We are actively listening and building this game with you. If you want your voice to be heard, join our official Discord and be part of the conversation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.poster.avif?t=1765357713\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.webm?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/extras/71048cb05f1bf3220667fd0806a23514.mp4?t=1765357713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, go and prove yourselves, Leapers. Dash into a lightning-fast adventure through the sky and get ready for a colorful death... Dismissed!</p>","developers":["Motion Twin"],"dlc":[3285350],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911610/e888fc3bd015016492f86ad87e21cbaea1d289e9/header.jpg?t=1765357713","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Motion Twin 2025<br />\r\nWindblown Privacy Policy: https://windblown.game/Legal/Privacy","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><str